 antiplatelet profile</article-title><source>Cardiovasc Drug Rev</source><year>2007</year><volume>25</volume><issue>4</issue><fpage>357</fpage><lpage>374</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18078435</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b16-vhrm-5-275"><label>16.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Michelson</surname><given-names>AD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>P2Y12 antagonism: promises and challenges</article-title><source>Arterioscler Thromb Vasc Biol.</source><year>2008</year><volume>28</volume><issue>3</issue><fpage>s33</fpage><lpage>s38</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18174449</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b17-vhrm-5-275"><label>17.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bertrand</surname><given-names>ME</given-names></name><name><surname>Rupprecht</surname><given-names>HJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Urban</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Double-blind study of the safety of clopidogrel with and without a loading dose in combination with aspirin compared with ticlopidine in combination with aspirin after coronary stenting: the clopidogrel aspirin stent international cooperative study (CLASSICS)</article-title><source>Circulation</source><year>2000</year><volume>102</volume><issue>6</issue><fpage>624</fpage><lpage>629</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10931801</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b18-vhrm-5-275"><label>18.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mehta</surname><given-names>SR</given-names></name><name><surname>Yusuf</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Peters</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Effects of pretreatment with clopidogrel and aspirin followed by long-term therapy in patients undergoing percutaneous coronary intervention: 